Switch iSmartHome_Hue_Lampen_Schalter "Licht Smart Home [%s]" <light> (iSmartHome_Hue_Lampen, gLichter) ["Switch", "Light"]
Color  iSmartHome_Hue_Lampen_Farbe "Farbe Smart Home" <colorwheel> (iSmartHome_Hue_Lampen) ["Control", "Color"]
Dimmer iSmartHome_Hue_Lampen_Helligkeit "Helligkeit Smart Home [%d %%]" <light> (iSmartHome_Hue_Lampen, gDimmbar) ["Control", "Light"]
Dimmer iSmartHome_Hue_Lampen_Farbtemperatur "Farbtemperatur Smart Home [%d %%]" <colorlight> (iSmartHome_Hue_Lampen, gDimmbar) ["Control", "ColorTemperature"]
